  - all-green PR: reports checks green
  - all-green PR: arms gh pr merge --auto --squash
  - all-green PR: applies the auto-merge-ok label
  - one failing check: refuses with exit 3
  - pending check: refuses (exit 3)
  - skipped check: refuses (fail-closed on non-pass)
  - no checks at all: refuses (fail-closed, not merge)
  - no live ruleset: refuses (exit 4) — --auto would merge on empty checks
  - already-merged PR: refuses
  - the not-green refusal is present and unconditional
